Fieldwright: third-party notices

Fieldwright is a fork of Shipwright (https://github.com/cherfia/shipwright),
used under the MIT License; its copyright notice is kept in LICENSE. Internal
names (docs/shipwright/, shipwright: markers, SHIPWRIGHT_* variables) are
Shipwright's, kept so upstream changes merge cleanly.

Shipwright's `plan`, `implement`, and `review` skills adapt the TDD,
planning, and code-review discipline of Superpowers
(https://github.com/obra/superpowers), reshaped for Shipwright's pipeline.
Superpowers is used under the MIT License, reproduced below with its
original copyright notice as required by that license.

